This extension adds Final Fantasy XVI modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Xbox (Game Pass)[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#ea9999]This game does not support symlinks. You must have the mod staging folder and the game on the same drive to use this extension.[/color][/b][/size]

[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs Reloaded Mod Manager itself, recognised by a "reloaded-ii.exe" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Mod Loader itself to the "Reloaded\Mods\FF16_Mod_Loader" folder, recognised by a file or folder named "modconfig.json" and a file or folder named "ff16.utility.modloader.dll".[/*]
[*]Installs Reloaded mod with a file or folder named "modconfig.json" to the "Reloaded\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Any other mod not described above is installed to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

